% Bibliography of "Crystallographic Closure of Integral Lorentzian Lattices and
% the Rank at Which It Ends".
%
% This paper has NO load-bearing import.  Every step is derived in the text: the
% integral timelike axis by orbit averaging, the reduction to the definite
% complement, the crystallographic restriction on a definite lattice of rank 3 by
% the trace argument, and the parity of the negative index from the structure of
% invariant forms.  The entries below are of two kinds only -- historical
% references for a classical statement, and the companion papers of the series.
% Nothing here carries a status of the paper.

